    {
      "title": "How-to and procedures",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Use `DB::table()` to select a MongoDB collection, chain constraints, and finish with `get()` or `first()`. Select a named MongoDB connection with `DB::connection()` when MongoDB is not the default connection. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/drivers/php/laravel-mongodb/current/interact-data/query-builder.md",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:c199a6e61e4bb8d27ae6c07663d7c307d80d5127897b0f6af15b164c044fb09b",
          "validationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "evidenceIds": [
