          "also": [
            "https://www.mongodb.com/community/forums/t/laravel-mongodb-4-2-released-with-laravel-11-support/271635"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laravel MongoDB provides MongoDB-backed Eloquent models and a fluent query builder; Laravel documents the integration as the mongodb/laravel-mongodb package maintained by MongoDB. (medium confidence)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/drivers/php/laravel-mongodb/current/model-data/model-class.md",
