            "ev:c25546e31e77553056140effcc8645b1ce4437cf3719c8923f8a1f53bd1d0463"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The query builder supports filtering nested fields with dotted paths, sorting with `orderBy()`, and skipping results with `skip()`; `whereRaw()` accepts MongoDB Query API filters. (low confidence)",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/drivers/php/laravel-mongodb/current/interact-data/query-builder.md",
